  "title": {
    "zh": "儿童堡垒帐篷拼搭积木套装",
    "en": "Kids Fort Tent Building Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款面向儿童创意拼搭与亲子互动的堡垒帐篷积木套装，采用杆件与连接球组合，可用于家庭、课堂和活动空间中的快速造型搭建。\n\n产品品牌为尧顺，材质为塑料/塑胶，产地东莞茶山，并包含专利/著作权申请信息，适合跨境渠道和长期供货场景。",
    "en": "This is a kids fort-tent building set designed for creative construction and parent-child interaction. With rods and connector balls, it supports quick shape building for homes, classrooms, and activity spaces.\n\nBrand: Yaoshun. Material: plastic. Origin: Chashan, Dongguan. Patent/copyright filing information is included, making it suitable for cross-border channels and long-term supply projects."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款儿童堡垒帐篷拼搭积木套装采用插珠式拼接结构，支持孩子自由组合搭建帐篷、城堡和主题空间，适用于家庭亲子互动和小组协作游戏场景。",
      "产品以塑料/塑胶材质为主，强调可重复拆装和形态变换，适合用于课堂活动、节庆布景和儿童活动区陈列。品牌为尧顺，产地东莞茶山。",
      "商品采用彩盒包装，便于零售与跨境渠道流通。该款记录包含专利及著作权申请时间信息，可满足渠道选品中的合规与资料归档需求。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This kids fort-tent set uses a bead-and-rod connection design, allowing children to build tents, castles, and themed spaces freely. It works well for parent-child activities and group play scenarios.",
      "The product is mainly made of plastic and supports repeated assembly and shape transformation, making it suitable for classroom activities, seasonal display setups, and children’s play-area presentation. Brand: Yaoshun. Origin: Chashan, Dongguan.",
      "Packed in a color box, the item is convenient for retail and cross-border distribution. Patent and copyright filing time is included in the product record for channel documentation and compliance reference."
    ]
  },
